trength":"strong","evidence":["Rubber; new pneumatic tyres, of a kind used on buses or lorries: $0.3bn, growing 50%/yr","Vinyl chloride, other halogenated olefin polymers; poly(vinyl chloride), not mixed with any other substances, in primary forms: $0.3bn, growing 17%/yr"]},{"headline":"India, Spain, Netherlands take 30% of exports","detail":"Export destinations are reasonably spread, which means established routes and documentation for several markets rather than just one.","angle":"partner","strength":"moderate","evidence":["India: 11.2% ($5.9bn)","Spain: 9.3% ($4.9bn)","Netherlands: 9.3% ($4.9bn)"]},{"headline":"Most imports arrive from China","detail":"China supplies 30% of what Nigeria imports. If you are sourcing to sell here, that is your incumbent competition and the price you have to beat. If you are buying, those trade lanes already exist.","angle":"partner","strength":"moderate","evidence":["China: 29.8% ($13.0bn)","United States: 12.8% ($5.6bn)","India: 9.9% ($4.3bn)"]},{"headline":"2025 trade surplus of $11.7bn","detail":"Nigeria sells more than it buys. Surplus economies usually have foreign currency available, which makes getting paid and repatriating profit simpler.","angle":"risk","strength":"watch","evidence":["Exports $56.1bn vs imports $44.4bn in 2025","Exports moved 7.1% year on year"]},{"headline":"Early signal: petroleum oils and oils from bituminous minerals, not containing biodiesel, not crude, not waste oils; preparations n.e.c, containing by weight 70% or more of petroleum oils or oils from bituminous minerals; light oils and preparations","detail":"Not a headline product yet, but growing 1501% a year. Categories that hold that rate tend to reprice the market before they show up in the top ten, which is the window where entry is cheapest.","angle":"timing","strength":"strong","evidence":["Minerals & energy: growing 1501% a year since 2022, now 3.21% of exports at rank 7. Largest counterpart across all exports is India. Growth is uneven, so treat the projection as directional."]}]','2026-09-06 10:18:31'),('res_235b13e5842447c4991646','ent_kenya','run_846af31cf50e4a579e044c','overview','{"year":2024,"export_usd":8255797029.967,"import_usd":20203122341.75,"balance_usd":-11947325311.783,"total_trade_usd":28458919371.717,"export_yoy_pct":15.334883083869725,"import_yoy_pct":8.592942519668537,"export_concentration":0.07977815465329365,"export_chapter_shares":{"10":0.0032139746874460767,"11":0.002737408505196235,"12":0.008695032576437306,"13":0.0018550928539560925,"14":0.0000048036835033683164,"15":0.03539750229908922,"16":0.0007747460339425421,"17":0.00788047445593219,"18":0.0005806612691179891,"19":0.004286092715284454,"20":0.015625545463845657,"21":0.018581063220573193,"22":0.006601109683316798,"23":0.007317660002871478,"24":0.011772937739048568,"25":0.02609469381878849,"26":0.01791683899678274,"27":0.12896100488840556,"28":0.011161386969247072,"29":0.0007865179809329119,"30":0.021137861735287828,"31":0.006540099783222132,"32":0.004179933946625419,"33":0.006325222941947908,"34":0.019191559107124966,"35":0.0014702874627298662,"36":0.0018359948435001999,"37":0.00003384734108478739,"38":0.007188269649508523,"39":0.01896251067725968,"40":0.0006004217344501524,"41":0.0023619703631549524,"42":0.0002868751667953786,"43":0.000011481714685565845,"44":0.0018513473069316484,"45":2.5800052887310758e-11,"46":0.000206976323521273,"47":0.00018132886365380363,"48":0.007614724517672224,"49":0.002707238569683533,"50":2.935339848114307e-7,"51":0.00021443412932445916,"52":0.0003426907189858561,"53":0.006029801653470526,"54":0.00009117051003895517,"55":0.0010365876447711413,"56":0.0005861894735826031,"57":0.00003662022587312588,"58":0.000040255800232701345,"59":0.00004093206722179224,"60":0.00008541735297518451,"61":0.029024179188186255,"62":0.02201375422304569,"63":0.004306369115902397,"64":0.002086570207997596,"65":0.00015794997106482022,"66":0.00007587026979061471,"67":0.00243043460239781,"68":0.0004983075590482924,"69":0.